## SPARQL Protocol and RDF Query Language
SELECT ?projectLabel ?countryLabel  
WHERE {  
    GRAPH <http://worldbank.270a.info/graph/meta> {  
        ?country property:income-level income-level:LMC .  
        ?country wgs:lat ?latitude . FILTER (?latitude > 0)  
        ?country skos:prefLabel ?countryLabel . }  
    GRAPH <http://worldbank.270a.info/graph/world-bank-projects-and-operations> {  
        ?project property:country ?country ; skos:prefLabel ?projectLabel . }  
}  
ORDER BY ?projectLabel
See results at World Bank Linked Data SPARQL Endpoint.
